{"title":"boundaries of blackberries, virgo ii","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/virgo-ii-blackberrying","date":1757493720000,"content":"<figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a9a41561-494d-4512-89ab-4da0d84ca940/VirgoII.png?format=1000w\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a9a41561-494d-4512-89ab-4da0d84ca940/VirgoII.png?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a9a41561-494d-4512-89ab-4da0d84ca940/VirgoII.png?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a9a41561-494d-4512-89ab-4da0d84ca940/VirgoII.png?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a9a41561-494d-4512-89ab-4da0d84ca940/VirgoII.png?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a9a41561-494d-4512-89ab-4da0d84ca940/VirgoII.png?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a9a41561-494d-4512-89ab-4da0d84ca940/VirgoII.png?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a9a41561-494d-4512-89ab-4da0d84ca940/VirgoII.png?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n \n\n\n  <p><em>an illustration for my collaboration with LJ of </em><a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Ceremony</em></a><em> for their communal writing practice, </em><a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/atmospheres\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Atmospheres</em></a><em>, guided by the 36 decans of the astrological year. all illustrations and writings are inspired by LJ’s work. </em></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n  <p><strong><em>Virgo II</em></strong><em> — 4 September - 13 September <br /></em><strong><em>Key themes from LJ</em></strong><em> — blackberries, ripeness and rot, thresholds, brambles, boundaries<br /></em><strong><em>before this: </em></strong><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/virgo-i-the-craft\" target=\"_blank\"><em>the minty clarity of virgo I, the craft</em></a><em> <br /><br /></em></p><p>I’m obsessed with fairytale retellings, and the symbolisms behind them. it was the first time I’ve ever thought about blackberries in this way — that on the other side of heavy summer sweetness is rot, and hard Saturnian boundaries of thorny brambles. in this illustration, Sleeping Beauty’s castle is surrounded by thorns. I think of enchantments to prevent curses, and the ways we guard sexuality. the work that is <em>waking up</em>. waking yourself up, or waiting for a prince to wake you up <em>(into what? freedom? another captivity?)</em> <br /><br />*</p><p>I had a wisdom tooth pulled shortly after drawing this. that day, I tasted blood in my mouth and felt the contours of pain, like a skeletal frame or corset that held me in place. it felt like an echoing of blackberries and brambles. there was something pleasurable about meeting the outline of pain. stop here. go no further. don’t open your mouth. I wondered about emotional boundaries and the ways in which, in my day to day life, I could bring more tenderness to the ways in which I taste pleasure, and touch pain. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n  <h1>process</h1>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bc2e8657-4129-418a-9cdd-5cf7be31ef43/virgo_ii_process.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bc2e8657-4129-418a-9cdd-5cf7be31ef43/virgo_ii_process.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bc2e8657-4129-418a-9cdd-5cf7be31ef43/virgo_ii_process.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bc2e8657-4129-418a-9cdd-5cf7be31ef43/virgo_ii_process.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bc2e8657-4129-418a-9cdd-5cf7be31ef43/virgo_ii_process.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bc2e8657-4129-418a-9cdd-5cf7be31ef43/virgo_ii_process.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bc2e8657-4129-418a-9cdd-5cf7be31ef43/virgo_ii_process.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bc2e8657-4129-418a-9cdd-5cf7be31ef43/virgo_ii_process.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n          \n          <figcaption>\n            <p>early sketch</p>\n          </figcaption>\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n             